# Design Consistency

- Use `AppTypography` styles for all visible text; avoid ad-hoc font sizes.
- Keep layout spacing on the 4pt grid (`4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48`).
- Keep touch targets at least `48x48`.
- Reuse system radii (`6, 8, 12, 20, 24`) and avoid one-off border radii.
- Prefer tokenized colors from `Theme.of(context).colorScheme` and approved `AppColors`.
- For editable forms, keep label/input sizing consistent across rows.
- For section headers and app bars, match established header scale before introducing larger text.
